      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "### AB Wildcard\nOne node expands the whole prompt language:\n\n- `$name = {a|b}` variables, `$name.upper`\n- `{a|b}` choices, `{5::a|3::b}` weights, `{50%a|b}` chance\n- `__examples/lighting__` wildcard files\n- `<[warrior]>` cards by tag\n- `[if $color=red : … | …]` conditions\n- `//` comments\n\nType `__`, `<[` or `$` for autocomplete, **Cmd/Ctrl+F** to find, or switch the find bar to *Wildcards* to search file contents."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "### AB Wildcard\nOne node expands the whole prompt language:\n\n- `$name = {a|b}` variables, `$name.upper`\n- `{a|b}` choices, `{5::a|3::b}` weights, `{50%a|b}` chance\n- `__examples/lighting__` wildcard files\n- `<[warrior]>` cards by tag\n- `[if $color=red : … | …]` conditions\n- `//` comments\n\nType `__`, `<[` or `$` for autocomplete, **Cmd/Ctrl+F** to find, or switch the find bar to *Wildcards* to search file contents."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
