      "widgets_values": [
        "### Sequences\nNot random: they step with the seed. Leave the seed on **increment** and queue several runs.\n\n- `{~a|b|c}` step: a, b, c, a …\n- `{@a|b} {@x|y}` every combination once\n- `{!a|b|c}` shuffled deck, no repeats per round\n- `__~examples/moods__` step through a file"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "### Sequences\nNot random: they step with the seed. Leave the seed on **increment** and queue several runs.\n\n- `{~a|b|c}` step: a, b, c, a …\n- `{@a|b} {@x|y}` every combination once\n- `{!a|b|c}` shuffled deck, no repeats per round\n- `__~examples/moods__` step through a file"
      },
