      "widgets_values": [
        "### Save and load\n**AB Wildcard Save** writes lines to `ComfyUI/wildcards/<name>.txt` and outputs the whole file.\n\n- *add new lines* skips lines the file already has, so a list grows over many runs\n- the file works as `__demo/colors__` right away\n\n**AB Wildcard Load** reads any `.txt` wildcard file. Its `lines` output is a list: nodes after it run once per line.\n\nNew files show up in Load's list after reloading the page."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "### Save and load\n**AB Wildcard Save** writes lines to `ComfyUI/wildcards/<name>.txt` and outputs the whole file.\n\n- *add new lines* skips lines the file already has, so a list grows over many runs\n- the file works as `__demo/colors__` right away\n\n**AB Wildcard Load** reads any `.txt` wildcard file. Its `lines` output is a list: nodes after it run once per line.\n\nNew files show up in Load's list after reloading the page."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
