      "widgets_values": [
        "### AB Prompt Mix\nType up to four prompt pieces (or connect them) and choose **pick**:\n\n- *each by chance*: every piece with its own chance in %\n- *one by weight*: exactly one piece, by relative weight\n\nPieces may contain wildcard syntax: send the result into **AB Wildcard** to expand it.\n\nHere the style mix (one by weight) feeds piece 4 of the scene mix."
      ],
